{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>昨（22日）晚近11時，警方接獲大埔汀角路有途人報案，指懷疑有司機酒後駕駛。警員接報到場，並截查上址一輛私家車，車上一名姓梁（42歲）男司機未能通過酒精呼氣測試，涉嫌酒後駕駛被捕。他已獲准保釋候查，須於12月下旬向警方報到。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T18:44:12.953134+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":112,"images":0,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T18:31:56+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T03:42:58.460035+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T18:37:43.117825+00:00","content_hash":"6f256a2ee7404e78226ac52401bbbc68cf700faa722a667ba4b5c213f1c0af20","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}